                              shabbos:{on:bool, city:key|"custom", lat, lon, tz, israel:bool, before:min, after:min}  (Shabbos & Yom Tov lock, whole computer)
     "pt613meta:parentday"  today     {date:"YYYY-MM-DD" (local), used:{pid:seconds}, bonus:{pid:minutes}, warned:{key:1}, allow:{pid:until ms},
                                       ageok:{pid:[game ids a grown-up allowed today, over the age limit]}, grace:{pid:ms when today's finish-up time ends}}
   A game shown as "on" is anything NOT in hidden[], so new games are on for everyone by default.
